      "width": 290,
      "height": 114,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "skyIrradiance(N):\n blend zenith \u00b7 horizon(azimuth of N)\n \u00b7 dim ground bounce, by N.y\n\u2248 cosine-weighted hemisphere\n  integral of a low-freq sky\n\u00d7 SP_IBL_DIFFUSE\ngated (1 \u2212 0.5\u00b7metallic)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
