      "y": 240,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 154,
      "strokeColor": "#e67700",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "prefiltered = compute_sky_color(\n  reflect(\u2212V, N))\n lerp\u2192skyIrradiance as rough\u2191\n (low-freq sky: lerp \u2248 mip chain)\n\nab = envBRDFApprox(N\u00b7V, rough)\n  (Karis Mobile analytic env-BRDF)\nspec = prefiltered \u00b7 (F0\u00b7ab.x + ab.y)\n\u00d7 SP_IBL_SPECULAR",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
