      "id": "text-7000018",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 44,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "envBRDFApprox (Karis):  ab = f(N\u00b7V, roughness)   \u2192   spec = prefiltered \u00b7 (F0\u00b7ab.x + ab.y)\nEnergy-conserving & roughness-aware: glossy paint reflects a crisp sky, matte cabin ~1\u20132%, grazing rims brighten.\nSP_IBL_* = sp.iblParams.xy under SWISH_DEBUG_UI, literal 1.0 in release (IBL always on; strength tunable in debug).",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
